{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-post-template-tsx","path":"/posts/vue/navigation-guard/","result":{"data":{"allMarkdownRemark":{"edges":[{"node":{"html":"<h2 id=\"navigation-guard\" style=\"position:relative;\">Navigation Guard<a href=\"#navigation-guard\" aria-label=\"navigation guard permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h2>\n<p>네비게이션 가드는 특정 URL에 접근(Navigation) 하기 전에 불려지는 (Hook)의 일종으로, 다른 페이지로 우회 하거나 접근 자체를 취소시킬 수 있기 때문에 네비게이션 가드라고 불립니다.</p>\n<p>사용자의 권한에 따라 페이지 접근을 막거나 페이지를 로딩하기 전에 데이터를 미리 불러올 때 사용하기 좋은 기술입니다. 사실상 싱글 페이지 어플리케이션을 구현할 때는 거의 필수로 구현해야 합니다.</p>\n<h2 id=\"네비게이션-가드-종류\" style=\"position:relative;\">네비게이션 가드 종류<a href=\"#%EB%84%A4%EB%B9%84%EA%B2%8C%EC%9D%B4%EC%85%98-%EA%B0%80%EB%93%9C-%EC%A2%85%EB%A5%98\" aria-label=\"네비게이션 가드 종류 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h2>\n<p>네비게이션 가드의 종류는 적용되는 위치, 범위에 따라서 전역, 지역, 컴포넌트 3가지로 나뉩니다.</p>\n<h3 id=\"전역-가드\" style=\"position:relative;\">전역 가드<a href=\"#%EC%A0%84%EC%97%AD-%EA%B0%80%EB%93%9C\" aria-label=\"전역 가드 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h3>\n<p>전역 가드는 모든 라우팅에 적용되는 네비게이션 가드입니다. 라우터의 beforeEach라는 메소드를 통해 전역가드의 로직을 설정할 수 있습니다. 아래는 전역 가드를 설정하는 예시 코드입니다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"js\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-js line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-js\"><span class=\"token keyword\">var</span> router <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">VueRouter</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n\r\nrouter<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">beforeEach</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token keyword\">function</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token parameter\">to<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> from<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> next</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token comment\">// ...</span>\r\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<p>뷰 라우터 인스턴스를 하나 생성하고 해당 인스턴스를 참조하는 변수에 beforeEach() API 함수를 호출합니다. 인자로 받은 3개의 변수는 다음과 같은 역할을 합니다.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>to: 이동 할 url</li>\n<li>from: 현재 url</li>\n<li>next: to에서 지정ㅈ한 url로 이동하기 위해 꼭 호출해야 하는 함수</li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote class=\"prompt-tip\">\n<p>next 함수 인자에 따라서 라우팅 허용 여부가 달라집니다.<br>\nnext() : 라우팅 승인<br>\nnext(false) : 라우팅 취소<br>\nnext(’/’) : 특정 라우트로 진입 (route.push 처럼 진입하고자 하는 경로 지정 가능)</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"지역-가드\" style=\"position:relative;\">지역 가드<a href=\"#%EC%A7%80%EC%97%AD-%EA%B0%80%EB%93%9C\" aria-label=\"지역 가드 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h3>\n<p>지역 가드는 라우팅별로 적용되는 네비게이션 가드입니다. 아래와 같이 특정 라우트의 beforeEnter 속성에 호출할 함수를 지정합니다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"js\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-js line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-js\"><span class=\"token keyword\">var</span> router <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">VueRouter</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token literal-property property\">routes</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>\r\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n      <span class=\"token literal-property property\">path</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">'/News'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\r\n      <span class=\"token literal-property property\">component</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> NewsView<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\r\n      <span class=\"token function-variable function\">beforeEnter</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">function</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token parameter\">to<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> from<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> next</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n        EventBus<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">$emit</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'start:spinner'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n        \r\n        store<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">dispatch</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>dispatchName<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> to<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>name<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\r\n          <span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">then</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=></span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n            <span class=\"token comment\">// EventBus.$emit('end:spinner'); // mixin mounted()로 이동</span>\r\n            <span class=\"token function\">next</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span> <span class=\"token comment\">// next() 함수를 호출해야 페이지가 이동 된다.</span>\r\n          <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\r\n          <span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">catch</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token parameter\">e</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=></span> console<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">log</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>e<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n      <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\r\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\r\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<h3 id=\"컴포넌트-가드\" style=\"position:relative;\">컴포넌트 가드<a href=\"#%EC%BB%B4%ED%8F%AC%EB%84%8C%ED%8A%B8-%EA%B0%80%EB%93%9C\" aria-label=\"컴포넌트 가드 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h3>\n<p>컴포넌트 가드는 컴포넌트 인스턴스를 통해 라우팅을 제어하는 네비게이션 가드입니다. 목적에 따라 다시 세 종류로 나뉘지만 인자들은 앞에서 살펴본 전역, 지역 가드와 동일합니다.</p>\n<h4 id=\"beforerouteenter\" style=\"position:relative;\">beforeRouteEnter<a href=\"#beforerouteenter\" aria-label=\"beforerouteenter permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h4>\n<p><code class=\"language-text\">beforeRouteEnter</code>는 컴포넌트 인스턴스가 생성되기 전에 호출됩니다. 인스턴스 생성 전이기 때문에 this를 통한 인스턴스 접근은 불가능합니다. 대신 인스턴스를 조작하는 콜백을 next에 전달하면 인스턴스가 생성된 이후에 콜백이 호출됩니다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"vue\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-vue line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-vue\">&lt;script&gt;\r\nexport default {\r\n  data() {\r\n    return {\r\n      state: &#39;pending&#39;\r\n    }\r\n  },\r\n  beforeRouteEnter(to, from, next) {\r\n    // 네비게이션 승인 후 state를 업데이트\r\n    next((vm) =&gt; (vm.state = &#39;approved&#39;));\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n&lt;/script&gt;</code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<h4 id=\"beforerouteupdate\" style=\"position:relative;\">beforeRouteUpdate<a href=\"#beforerouteupdate\" aria-label=\"beforerouteupdate permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h4>\n<p><code class=\"language-text\">beforeRouteUpdate</code>는 동일한 컴포넌트를 사용하지만 페이지 주소가 바뀔 경우 호출됩니다. 동적 라우팅을 통해서 페이지의 주소만 바뀌고 같은 컴포넌트를 재활용하는 경우를 예로 들 수 있습니다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"js\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-js line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-js\"><span class=\"token keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">VueRouter</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token literal-property property\">routes</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span> <span class=\"token literal-property property\">path</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">'/foo/:id'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token literal-property property\">component</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> Foo <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\r\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<p><strong>현재 URL : /foo/1</strong></p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"vue\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-vue line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-vue\">&lt;script&gt;\r\nexport default {\r\n  beforeRouteUpdate(to, from, next) {\r\n    console.log(this.$route.params.id);  // 1\r\n    next();\r\n  },\r\n  methods: {\r\n    moveToNext() {\r\n      // 페이지를 이동하기 전에 beforeRouteUpdate를 호출합니다.\r\n      this.$router.push(&#39;/foo/2&#39;);\r\n    }\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n&lt;/script&gt;</code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<h4 id=\"beforerouteleave\" style=\"position:relative;\">beforeRouteLeave<a href=\"#beforerouteleave\" aria-label=\"beforerouteleave permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h4>\n<p><code class=\"language-text\">beforeRouteLeave</code>는 해당 컴포넌트를 벗어나 새로운 펭지로 이동할 때 호출됩니다. 보통 사용자가 변경사항을 저장하지 않고 갑작스럽게 사이트를 벗어난 경우 사용됩니다. next(false)로 페이지 이동을 막을 수 있습니다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"js\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-js line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-js\"><span class=\"token function\">beforeRouteLeave</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token parameter\">to<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> from<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> next</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> answer <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> window<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">confirm</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'사이트에서 나가시겠습니까? 변경사항이 저장되지 않을 수 있습니다.'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>answer<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n    <span class=\"token function\">next</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">else</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n    <span class=\"token function\">next</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token boolean\">false</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\r\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<h2 id=\"네비게이션-가드-호출-순서-flow\" style=\"position:relative;\">네비게이션 가드 호출 순서 (flow)<a href=\"#%EB%84%A4%EB%B9%84%EA%B2%8C%EC%9D%B4%EC%85%98-%EA%B0%80%EB%93%9C-%ED%98%B8%EC%B6%9C-%EC%88%9C%EC%84%9C-flow\" aria-label=\"네비게이션 가드 호출 순서 flow permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h2>\n<ol>\n<li>비활성화 되는 컴포넌트에서 <code class=\"language-text\">beforeRouteLeave</code> 호출</li>\n<li>전역 가드 <code class=\"language-text\">beforeEach</code> 호출</li>\n<li>재사용되는 컴포넌트라면 <code class=\"language-text\">beforeRouteUpdate</code> 호출</li>\n<li>지역 가드 <code class=\"language-text\">beforeEnter</code> 호출</li>\n<li>활성화 되는 컴포넌트에서 <code class=\"language-text\">beforeRouteEnter</code> 호출</li>\n<li><code class=\"language-text\">beforeRouteEnter</code>의 next에 넘겨준 콜백 호출</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"네비게이션-가드로-인증-정보-확인\" style=\"position:relative;\">네비게이션 가드로 인증 정보 확인<a href=\"#%EB%84%A4%EB%B9%84%EA%B2%8C%EC%9D%B4%EC%85%98-%EA%B0%80%EB%93%9C%EB%A1%9C-%EC%9D%B8%EC%A6%9D-%EC%A0%95%EB%B3%B4-%ED%99%95%EC%9D%B8\" aria-label=\"네비게이션 가드로 인증 정보 확인 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h2>\n<p>네비게이션 가드가 가장 많이 쓰이는 곳은 사용자 인증 정보에 따라 접근을 막는 로직입니다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"js\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-js line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-js\">router<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">beforeEach</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">function</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token parameter\">to<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> from<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> next</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token comment\">// to: 이동 url에 해당하는 라우팅 객체</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\r\n    to<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>matched<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">some</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token keyword\">function</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token parameter\">routeInfo</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n      <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> routeInfo<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>meta<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>authRequired<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n    <span class=\"token comment\">// 이동 할 페이지에 인증 정보가 필요하면 경고 창을 띄우고 페이지 전환은 하지 않음</span>\r\n    <span class=\"token function\">alert</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'Login Please!'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">else</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n    console<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">log</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token template-string\"><span class=\"token template-punctuation string\">`</span><span class=\"token string\">routing success: '</span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token interpolation-punctuation punctuation\">${</span>to<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>path<span class=\"token interpolation-punctuation punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">'</span><span class=\"token template-punctuation string\">`</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n    <span class=\"token function\">next</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>  <span class=\"token comment\">// 페이지 전환</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\r\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<hr>\n<br>\n<h5>참고</h5>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://joshua1988.github.io/vue-camp/advanced/navigation-guard.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">캡틴판교 | Cracking Vue.js | Navigation Guard</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://joshua1988.github.io/web-development/vuejs/vue-router-navigation-guards/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">캡틴판교 | 라우터 네비게이션 가드 알아보기</a></li>\n</ul>","tableOfContents":"<ul>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"#navigation-guard\">Navigation Guard</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"#%EB%84%A4%EB%B9%84%EA%B2%8C%EC%9D%B4%EC%85%98-%EA%B0%80%EB%93%9C-%EC%A2%85%EB%A5%98\">네비게이션 가드 종류</a></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"#%EC%A0%84%EC%97%AD-%EA%B0%80%EB%93%9C\">전역 가드</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"#%EC%A7%80%EC%97%AD-%EA%B0%80%EB%93%9C\">지역 가드</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"#%EC%BB%B4%ED%8F%AC%EB%84%8C%ED%8A%B8-%EA%B0%80%EB%93%9C\">컴포넌트 가드</a></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"#beforerouteenter\">beforeRouteEnter</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#beforerouteupdate\">beforeRouteUpdate</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#beforerouteleave\">beforeRouteLeave</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"#%EB%84%A4%EB%B9%84%EA%B2%8C%EC%9D%B4%EC%85%98-%EA%B0%80%EB%93%9C-%ED%98%B8%EC%B6%9C-%EC%88%9C%EC%84%9C-flow\">네비게이션 가드 호출 순서 (flow)</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"#%EB%84%A4%EB%B9%84%EA%B2%8C%EC%9D%B4%EC%85%98-%EA%B0%80%EB%93%9C%EB%A1%9C-%EC%9D%B8%EC%A6%9D-%EC%A0%95%EB%B3%B4-%ED%99%95%EC%9D%B8\">네비게이션 가드로 인증 정보 확인</a></p>\n</li>\n</ul>","fields":{"gitLastModified":"Oct 2, 2026"},"frontmatter":{"title":"Navigation Guard","summary":"Navigation Guard 네비게이션 가드는 특정 URL에 접근(Navigation) 하기 전에 불려지는 (Hook)의 일종으로, 다른 페이지로 우회 하거나 접근 자체를 취소시킬 수 있기 때문에 네비게이션 가드라고 불립니다. 사용자의 권한에 따라 페이지 접근을 막거나 페이지를 로딩하기 전에 데이터를 미리 불러올 때 사용하기 좋은 기술입니다. 사실상 싱글 페이지 어플리케이션을 구현할 때는 거의 필수로 구현해야 합니다.","date":"Jan 31, 2024","categories":["VUE"],"tags":[],"author":["aluvy"],"thumbnail":null}}}]}},"pageContext":{"slug":"/posts/vue/navigation-guard/","prev":{"slug":"/posts/vue/mixin/","title":"mixin | Component recycling"},"next":{"slug":"/posts/vue/vue_loading_spinner_eventbus/","title":"LoadingSpinner | EventBus"}}},"staticQueryHashes":["1397594759","2043619371"],"slicesMap":{}}